   681→ * Calculate safety record component of trust (0-0.15 scale)
   682→ * FIX #2A (Oct 19, 2025): Reduced from 20% to 15% (safety less important than performance)
   683→ * Research: Incident-free operation builds trust over time
   684→ */
   685→function calculateSafetyRecord(state: GameState): number {
   686→  // Check for recent safety incidents in event log
